# The Dominion Bracelet: equipped, Grizzly Bears is a 3/3 with "{15}, Exile The Dominion Bracelet: You control target opponent
# during their next turn. This ability costs {X} less to activate, where X is this creature's power. Activate only as a
# sorcery." The ruling's own example: power 3, so the ability costs {12} (CR 601.2f by way of 602.2b). On turn 7 it is refused
# in Bot1's draw step (CR 602.5d, 307.1), and Bot1 itself is refused as its target; in the main phase twelve mana pays
# it exactly, the Bracelet is exiled (the Bears back to 2/2), and Bot1 controls Bot2 during turn 8, Bot2's next turn, and not
# during turn 10 (CR 723.1).

